ategic positioning and unleash powerful skill combos with your party.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690140/extras/02d461696de06b98f8037704f0c9404f.poster.avif?t=1701836059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690140/extras/02d461696de06b98f8037704f0c9404f.webm?t=1701836059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690140/extras/02d461696de06b98f8037704f0c9404f.mp4?t=1701836059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free Exploration:</h2> When not in combat, investigate the environment, find documents, collect treasures, solve riddles, and uncover secrets.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690140/extras/03bc825704d6c64ae36170d75370094d.poster.avif?t=1701836059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690140/extras/03bc825704d6c64ae36170d75370094d.webm?t=1701836059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690140/extras/03bc825704d6c64ae36170d75370094d.mp4?t=1701836059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Party Customization:</h2> Adapt heroes to your play style, manage your team and progress by unlocking over 70 unique passive or active skills.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690140/extras/081a0dda064f30f50c8bf3229152b897.poster.avif?t=1701836059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690140/extras/081a0dda064f30f50c8bf3229152b897.webm?t=1701836059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=